  "concept": "**Technical Brief: Low Poly Test Cube (15cm FDM Calibration Print)**\n\nA **single-piece low-poly geometric test cube (150x150x150mm)** with angular faceted surfaces ($fn=6 for 6-sided geometry), flat base for bed adhesion, and zero overhangs for support-free FDM printing on PLA. **Print orientation: flat base down; wall thickness 1.2mm minimum; estimated 3-4 hour print, 25-30g material; NO supports required.** **Key design: 6-sided low-poly aesthetic, sharp angular edges, perfect for nozzle/bed calibration and layer adhesion testing.**\n\n---\n\n**OpenSCAD Code:**\n\n```openscad\n// LOW POLY TEST CUBE - SUPPORT-FREE FDM\n$fn = 6;\nscale = 1.5;\n\n// Main cube body\ncube([150*scale, 150*scale, 150*scale], center=true);\n\n// Flat base (translate to Z=0)\ntranslate([0, 0, -75*scale])\n  cube([150*scale, 150*scale, 3*scale], center=true);\n```\n\n**Export as STL** → Slice in Cura → Print. ✅",
